-- Spatial recurrence (ex46): a fresh line stays zero under iteration. Twin of 089-spatial-recurrence.bqn (second assertion).
-- Iterate the step on a fresh line and nothing ever happens: zero in, zero out, eight times over.
-- Eight barriers apply eight stencil steps. Each reads its own pre-state, and the all-zero line remains zero through all eight.
--! registry ../registries/090-spatial-recurrence-b.reg
--! expect height = 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0

Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
Cell @ row , Height = prev.Height + prev.prev.Height
